{"id":3384,"date":"2026-06-24T09:02:41","date_gmt":"2026-06-24T09:02:41","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/?post_type=product&#038;p=3384"},"modified":"2026-10-02T06:05:05","modified_gmt":"2026-10-02T06:05:05","slug":"abstract-portrait-designer-wall-tile","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/product\/abstract-portrait-designer-wall-tile\/","title":{"rendered":"Abstract Portrait Designer Wall Tile"},"content":{"rendered":"<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"1199\">Jain Stones &amp; Tiles presents the <strong data-start=\"668\" data-end=\"714\">Abstract Portrait Designer Wall Tile Panel<\/strong>, an exclusive decorative wall tile solution designed for contemporary architectural spaces that celebrate artistic expression, modern luxury, and bold interior styling. Inspired by premium abstract art compositions, this designer wall panel beautifully combines a striking feminine portrait with layered botanical elements, free-flowing artistic textures, intricate leaf detailing, and contemporary brush-inspired artwork that transforms ordinary walls into premium design statements.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1699\">Crafted with a sophisticated combination of deep charcoal tones, warm copper shades, muted earthy textures, artistic floral overlays, and hand-painted abstract styling, this decorative tile panel creates a visually dramatic composition that adds depth, elegance, and refined artistic character to premium interiors. The unique fusion of portrait artwork and nature-inspired detailing creates a luxurious centerpiece ideal for spaces designed with modern aesthetics and premium design sensibilities.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1701\" data-end=\"2315\">Manufactured using premium quality decorative wall tile materials and advanced surface finishing technology, this designer panel offers long-lasting durability, superior finish consistency, low maintenance performance, and excellent visual richness for everyday architectural applications. The bold artistic composition makes it a premium choice for luxury residences, designer living spaces, boutique hospitality projects, premium office interiors, reception feature walls, art-inspired commercial spaces, and bespoke architectural environments where statement design becomes the focal point of the overall space.<\/p>\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1c650df\" data-start=\"2322\" data-end=\"2350\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"2324\" data-end=\"2350\">Product Specifications<\/strong><\/span><\/h1>\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" style=\"height: 565px;\" width=\"738\" data-start=\"2352\" data-end=\"3239\">\n<thead data-start=\"2352\" data-end=\"2379\">\n<tr data-start=\"2352\" data-end=\"2379\">\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2352\" data-end=\"2368\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Specification<\/th>\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2368\" data-end=\"2379\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details<\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"3239\">\n<tr data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2439\">\n<td data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2425\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Product Category<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2425\" data-end=\"2439\" data-col-size=\"md\">Wall Tiles<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2440\" data-end=\"2471\">\n<td data-start=\"2440\" data-end=\"2448\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Brand<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2448\" data-end=\"2471\" data-col-size=\"md\">Jain Stones &amp; Tiles<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2472\" data-end=\"2540\">\n<td data-start=\"2472\" data-end=\"2488\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Material Type<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2488\" data-end=\"2540\" data-col-size=\"md\">Premium Decorative Ceramic \/ Vitrified Wall Tile<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2541\" data-end=\"2621\">\n<td data-start=\"2541\" data-end=\"2557\" data-col-size=\"sm\">